Package: longQTL
Type: Package
Title: Read-Level Methylation QTL Mapping from Long-Read Sequencing
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Lukas", "Laufer", email = "lukas.laufer@uni-saarland.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maps cis methylation quantitative trait loci (mQTL) from Oxford
    Nanopore long reads at the level of single molecules. Each read carries
    both its allele and its CpG methylation calls; longQTL models these
    jointly with beta-binomial generalized linear mixed models that separate
    the within-individual (allele-specific) from the between-individual
    (dosage) genetic effect. Supports cohort-scale scans with
    permutation-calibrated block-level significance and a single-patient
    mode that compares one individual against a reference panel.
